53397	43518	3297	PHILLY CHEESESTEAK	The original. The classic. The Steak Philly. Our steak philly cheesesteak is always made with high-quality USDA choice steak, grilled and seasoned to perfection. We add savory grilled green peppers, mushrooms, and onions and top off our cheesesteak with melted provolone cheese. This delicious cheesesteak is always served on a signature toasted roll. All cheesesteaks come with optional creamy mayonnaise, juicy tomato, shredded lettuce, and crispy pickle. The Steak Philly pairs perfectly with French Fries or Original Real-Fruit Lemonade.	8.19	https://images.pexels.com/photos/958545/pexels-photo-958545.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800	t	2026-09-24 00:35:18.216471	2026-09-24 00:35:18.216471
53398	43518	3297	CHICKEN CALIFORNIA	Our Chicken California cheesesteak is the perfect blend of savory, creamy, and zesty. We season and grill USDA-choice chicken and melt in smooth provolone cheese. We serve it on our signature toasted roll to add some crispiness to every bite of your cheesesteak. Then we top it off with creamy ranch dressing. What’s not to love? All cheesesteaks come with optional creamy mayonnaise, juicy tomato, shredded lettuce, and crispy pickle. The Chicken California pairs perfectly with Cheese and Bacon Fries or Real-Fruit Strawberry Lemonade.	6.99	https://images.pexels.com/photos/2338407/pexels-photo-2338407.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800	t	2026-09-24 00:35:18.216471	2026-09-24 00:35:18.216471
